    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>I'm Alonza Blanding, an OSINT practitioner from Goose Creek, South Carolina. I started this site to document my journey into open source intelligence — what I learn, what I get wrong, and how I improve over time — and to put those skills to work in the fight against human trafficking.</p>
